# Frontend

## Stack

- **Astro** prerender by default. Interactive UI = **Preact islands only**.
- Do not add React, Svelte, Vue, or Tailwind unless explicitly asked.
- Use CSS variables from `site/src/styles/tokens.css`. No one-off brand hex colors.

## Islands and JS budget

- Zero client JS by default. Prefer `client:visible` or `client:idle`.
- Reserve `client:load` for above-the-fold chrome only (e.g. lang/greeting toggles).
- Place-page JS ≤ **150 KB gzip** excluding the map. Lazy-load MapLibre off the critical path.
- Target Core Web Vitals p75: **LCP ≤ 2.5s**, **INP ≤ 200ms**, **CLS ≤ 0.1**.

## Images and fonts

```html
<!-- ✅ LCP / hero -->
<img src="…" width="800" height="450" fetchpriority="high" alt="…" />

<!-- ✅ below fold -->
<img src="…" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" alt="…" />
```

- Prefer WebP/AVIF. Always set width/height or `aspect-ratio` (CLS).
- Fonts: `font-display: swap` and a size-adjusted system fallback. Do not block first paint on Google Fonts.

## Product UX

- Every user-facing string has **`en` and `hi`**. Hindi default when `navigator.language` starts with `hi`.
- Primary share = WhatsApp (`wa.me`). No star ratings. Stale dated facts hide or show “Check locally”.
- Keep security headers in `site/public/_headers` (CSP, frame deny, nosniff).
